Fred,

The list of accounts is defined by a config file on your local machine. You can adjust this config file, but it's location depends on your OS. You can see the relveant R code here <https://github.com/rstudio/shinyapps/blob/b31ba82420bf38d46e39cb1d0013ba0f1745b3b6/R/config.R#L14:L21>.

-Andy

