Hello everyone!

I'm a little confused about how the function "deployApp()" understands the borders of the app to upload. In my ui.R file, I have a link to help/index.html (my slidified doc file), made with

tags$a(href="help/index.html", "Read the Documentation!"),

But, when I try and click, the link is broken, because the html file is missing on the Shinyapp server.

How should that work?
