I think the easiest thing for you to do is to put help/index.html
under the www directory of your app. This file is probably not missing
on ShinyApps, but the link does not work because shiny does not allow
arbitrary links without pre-registering the URL prefix (see
?shiny::addResourcePath).

Regards,
Yihui
--
